cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you refer to CiteFox in research or writing, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'CiteFox: AI visibility tracker for Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT and Perplexity'
abstract: >-
  CiteFox is a free, source-available desktop app that tracks whether Google AI
  Overviews, Google AI Mode, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Copilot cite a
  website for buyer questions, shows which page is cited and who is cited
  instead, writes fix briefs, tracks fixes over time and produces reports.
authors:
